The <span id="S6.T5.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-quote ltx_outerquote">“KG”</span> column tells if the state is bounded to only include binary relations, and the <span id="S6.T5.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-quote ltx_outerquote">“action arity”</span> column shows the number of arguments of actions, when actions are used rather than heuristics.</span></figcaption>
