<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A3.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Appendix C Box plots of scores per domain ‣ Vejde: A Framework for Inductive Deep Reinforcement Learning Based on Factor Graph Color Refinement" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure 4</span></a>shows box plots of average scores for each agent type for each domain.</p>
